1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,402
Match stats tell you what happened: 57%
possession, 13 shots.

2
00:00:05,452 --> 00:00:07,507
Not why the game turned.

3
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:12,926
Pivot finds the moments that turned a
match, explains why,

4
00:00:12,976 --> 00:00:16,793
and lets you replay it with one thing
changed.

5
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:21,162
Here's a synthetic match. Harbour City 3,
Northgate 1.

6
00:00:21,212 --> 00:00:24,588
Pivot found three turning points. A red
card.

7
00:00:24,638 --> 00:00:28,166
A substitution that pulled Harbour City
deeper.

8
00:00:28,216 --> 00:00:31,364
And a second change that won control back.

9
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:38,180
Pick one. The AI explains why it mattered,
and every number is checked.

10
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:43,793
Northgate's passes fell from 12 to 6.
Hover it to see its source.

11
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,836
So did the red card decide it?

12
00:00:46,886 --> 00:00:53,336
Remove it, and Pivot replays the rest of
the match 200 times each way.

13
00:00:53,386 --> 00:00:59,650
Harbour City's win chance drops from 80%
to 52%. A clear difference.

14
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:04,619
Two minutes after the red card, Harbour
City scored.

15
00:01:04,669 --> 00:01:07,079
Here it is at quarter speed.

16
00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:13,793
From a corner. Four attackers, three
defenders, and nobody tight on them.

17
00:01:15,100 --> 00:01:19,507
One click, and it's all in Chinese. Or
Spanish.

18
00:01:20,100 --> 00:01:24,412
Every card comes from a Microsoft Agent
Framework workflow.

19
00:01:24,462 --> 00:01:28,256
A Judge confirms the moment. An Explainer
writes it.

20
00:01:28,306 --> 00:01:30,844
A Verifier recomputes every number.

21
00:01:30,894 --> 00:01:36,536
Here, it caught the model giving Harbour
City the other team's pass accuracy,

22
00:01:36,586 --> 00:01:37,793
and sent it back.

23
00:01:38,100 --> 00:01:41,085
The agents run on Azure AI Foundry.

24
00:01:41,135 --> 00:01:45,507
Results live in Cosmos DB, matches in Blob
Storage.

25
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:50,407
Every match here is synthetic, as the
rules require.

26
00:01:50,457 --> 00:01:53,507
Next: real match data. This is Pivot.
